Day 97 – Indexes

Task:
Create index
👉 Understand:
Faster queries


db.users.createIndex({ email: 1 })
db.users.createIndex({ age: 1 })
db.users.getIndexes()
db.users.dropIndex({ email: 1 })
db.users.createIndex({
  name: 1,
  age: -1
})


Engineering Use Cases :>

Indexes are heavily used in:

Login Systems
Search by email

db.users.find({ email: "shivam@gmail.com" })

E-commerce
Search products
db.products.find({ category: "mobile" })

Example:

Amazon India

Social Media
Search users/posts

Example:

Instagram

Banking Apps
Fast transaction lookup